posts.body:
like on line 290 to 294 you read this:
JavaScript:
if ($gameSystem.isSideView()) {
            bitmap = ImageManager.loadSvEnemy(name, hue);
        } else {
            bitmap = ImageManager.loadEnemy(name, hue);
        }
rule out like:
JavaScript:
//if ($gameSystem.isSideView()) {
        //    bitmap = ImageManager.loadSvEnemy(name, hue);
        //} else {
            bitmap = ImageManager.loadEnemy(name, hue);
        //}
you draw the enemy from the FRONTVIEW, so long the enemy match
the sideview battle names (or animated) it draw that size, so you can draw
it bigger there if you like too
if you want to draw the animated one, you can try STV_EnemyBook
or one that could match.

